619
00:49:58.054 --> 00:50:04.613
comes from an international organization
such as the United Nations Security

620
00:50:04.613 --> 00:50:05.413
Council.

621
00:50:05.413 --> 00:50:09.114
Trade sanctions can be of two different
types:

622
00:50:09.114 --> 00:50:12.114
Unilateral and Multi-Lateral

623
00:50:12.114 --> 00:50:16.864
Unilateral trade sanctions are imposed by
one country.

624
00:50:16.864 --> 00:50:22.684
While multilateral trade sanctions are
