628
00:50:34.190 --> 00:50:38.664
by limiting international payment and
exchanges.

629
00:50:38.664 --> 00:50:44.724
or rather government may also provide
subsidies to domestic and internal

630
00:50:44.724 --> 00:50:45.524
industry

631
00:50:45.524 --> 00:50:51.114
The goal is to make them become more
competitive on the markets,

632
00:50:51.114 --> 00:50:56.270
but subsidies can also have a negative
impact on taxpayers.

633
00:50:56.270 --> 00:51:01.692
Quindi che cosa sono le sanzioni al
